   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 296 of the laws of 1992 incorporating the Rescue\nVolunteer and Exempt Firemen's Benevolent Association Inc., and providing for\nits powers and duties, in relation to the purpose of such corporation and the\nuse of certain tax monies received",
    "basePrintNo": "S7273",
